Your MongoDB code and bcrypt are not the problem yet. Express is not receiving the request body.

1. Make sure express.json() is before your route

Your file order should look like this:

import express from "express";

const app = express();

app.use(express.json());

app.post("/addUser", async (req, res) => {
    // req.body will now work
});

If you put:

app.use(express.json());

after your route, it won't apply.

